**Draft for legal review. This text is not approved yet and must not go live before the review.**

## Who we are

IVG Brasil is the Brazilian Chapter of the Internationale Vereinigung für Germanistik and is responsible for the data collected on this website.

## What we collect

- **Browsing:** we use Cloudflare Web Analytics to count visits. It does not use cookies and does not identify people.
- **Technical logs:** the server keeps IP addresses and browser data for a short period, for security and to fix errors.
- **Forms:** the contact and membership forms go live at launch. Once they exist, this page will say which data we ask for, why, and for how long we keep it.

## Cookies

The website does not use tracking or advertising cookies, so there is no cookie banner.

## Your rights

Under the Brazilian General Data Protection Law (Law 13,709/2018), you may ask for access to, correction of, or deletion of your data, and find out with whom it was shared.

## How to reach us

Write to IVG Brasil's contact e-mail, to be defined, with the subject "Privacy".

## Updates

This policy may change. The date of the latest review will be recorded here.
